{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["On Mount Sinai by the hand of Moshe — for the pericope of the Sabbatical year began thus: ״וידבר ה׳ אל משה בהר סיני״. And also the conclusion of these admonitions is on account of the Sabbatical year, as it is written: ״כל ימי השמה תשבות״, for all the commandments of the pericope 'On Mount Sinai' concern Sabbatical years and Jubilees — by prophecy and the sending forth of slaves and the return of lands. Therefore the admonitions for transgressions of the Sabbatical years are stated here 'on Mount Sinai' — everything at one time."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "Resolved ה׳ to HaShem per the rule reverent abbreviations ד׳/ה׳ → HaShem."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:33.382516033Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}